---
subject: You are no longer a team leader for {{ sector_name }}
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Team leader role removed</title></head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #333;">
  <h1>Hello {{ recipient_name }},</h1>
  <p>{{ actor_name }} updated sector <strong>{{ sector_name }}</strong> and you are no longer listed as a team leader.</p>
  <p><a href="{{ sector_url }}">Open sector</a></p>
</body>
</html>